*R Mac Plus v3 SCSI helper, $41FFC0 through $41FFCF.
*R The helper clears the loaded-driver bitmap, resets SCSI and calls SCSILoad.
*R The helper's original source and name have not been found.
*R SCSI.p defines the reset call as CLR.W -(SP) followed by _SCSIDispatch.
*R Hiram writes the following initials and date from target.json at build time.
*R The labels below are reconstruction names. See Evidence/rom-tail.json.

		IMPORT BaseOfROM,SCSILoad ;]

                INCLUDE 'HardwarePrivateEqu.a'
                INCLUDE 'SCSI.a'
                INCLUDE 'Traps.a'


ResetAndReloadSCSI PROC EXPORT ;]
                CLR.W   SCSIDrvrs ;]
                CLR.W   -(SP)
                _SCSIDispatch
                JSR     (SCSILoad-BaseOfROM+ROMStart).L ;]
                RTS
                ENDP

ROMTailEnd ;]
                END
